+      "statement": "Fleet flags --bucket, --endpoint, and --region and their environment fallbacks CELLD_BUCKET, S3_ENDPOINT, and AWS_REGION/AWS_DEFAULT_REGION mean one thing across every operator command.",
+      "evidence": [
